# Apollo DEV registry — never served over HTTP.
#
# This mirrors plugins/_inventory/.htaccess, which is proven to return 403
# on this host (LiteSpeed / Apache 2.4 semantics).
#
# Host constraints inherited from plugins/.htaccess — do not violate them:
#   NO <IfModule>   — broke the LiteSpeed line parser, 500 site-wide
#   NO Options      — outside AllowOverride scope here, proven 500
#   NO RewriteEngine in a subdirectory — drops the root rewrite context
# Only Require, which the parent file already proves works.

Require all denied
